{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2019-12-11","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2027-09-30","@type":"3"}],"/activity-status@code":"2","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Norvilus, Marcelin","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"The project¿s overarching goal is to sustainably increase the income and dietary\ndiversity of rural households in the country¿s eastern and northern regions. Its\ndevelopment objective is to provide assistance for family farming diversification\nand adaptation to CC to increase access to markets and dietary diversity in the\nBafatá, Cacheu, Gabú and Oio regions, in alignment with IFAD¿s Country Strategy\nNote (CSN), while fostering entrepreneurship among rural youth and women,\npersons with disabilities and migrants who have returned to the country and their\nintegration into regional and subregional trade corridors. The project will directly\ncontribute to the achievement of United Nations Sustainable Development Goals\n(SDG) 1, 2, 5, 8 and 13 and CSN objectives.The project¿s overarching goal is to sustainably increase the income and dietary\ndiversity of rural households in the country¿s eastern and northern regions. Its\ndevelopment objective is to provide assistance for family farming diversification\nand adaptation to CC to increase access to markets and dietary diversity in the\nBafatá, Cacheu, Gabú and Oio regions, in alignment with IFAD¿s Country Strategy\nNote (CSN), while fostering entrepreneurship among rural youth and women,\npersons with disabilities and migrants who have returned to the country and their\nintegration into regional and subregional trade corridors. The project will directly\ncontribute to the achievement of United Nations Sustainable Development Goals\n(SDG) 1, 2, 5, 8 and 13 and CSN objectives.The project¿s overarching goal is to sustainably increase the income and dietary\ndiversity of rural households in the country¿s eastern and northern regions. Its\ndevelopment objective is to provide assistance for family farming diversification\nand adaptation to CC to increase access to markets and dietary diversity in the\nBafatá, Cacheu, Gabú and Oio regions, in alignment with IFAD¿s Country Strategy\nNote (CSN), while fostering entrepreneurship among rural youth and women,\npersons with disabilities and migrants who have returned to the country and their\nintegration into regional and subregional trade corridors. The project will directly\ncontribute to the achievement of United Nations Sustainable Development Goals\n(SDG) 1, 2, 5, 8 and 13 and CSN objectives.","@xml:lang":"EN"}]}],"/document-link":[{"/category":[{"@code":"A01"},{"@code":"A07"},{"@code":"A08"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"Guinea-Bissau 2000001605: REDE Interim (Mid-term) Review Report June 2024","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"APPLICATION/PDF","@url":"https://operations.ifad.org/documents/654016/f3202b6e-df91-4414-93f1-6fd76f7df261"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A02"},{"@code":"A07"},{"@code":"A08"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"Guinea-Bissau 2000001605: REDE Supervision Report August 2025","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"APPLICATION/PDF","@url":"https://operations.ifad.org/documents/654016/ff6900c1-60d1-41b9-bf7d-3955cfad6d90"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A02"},{"@code":"A07"},{"@code":"A08"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"Guinea-Bissau 2000001605: REDE Supervision Report December 2023","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"APPLICATION/PDF","@url":"https://operations.ifad.org/documents/654016/dd4df124-1c4f-4d2c-a38b-dd122d05990c"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A02"},{"@code":"A07"},{"@code":